  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Establishment of an Integrated Primary Healthcare and Nutrition Facility, and furnish Multi-Purpose Centre (MPC) in Camp 11, Ukhiya, Cox&#x2019;s Bazar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to establish and furnish an Integrated Primary Healthcare and Nutrition Facility and furnish a Multi-Purpose Centre (MPC) in Camp 11 that was completely destroyed by fire. This UNICEF project supports one functional health facility for integrated health and nutrition and provides protection support to 2,000 children through the re-equipping and rebuilding of a MPC with necessary supplies. The project aims to reach 33,942 people, including 7,844 men, 8,654 women, 8,809 boys, 8,635 girls, and 1,696 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
